            "reasoning_content": "The customer asks for a refund of the price difference (a credit/reversal of a price increase) on the subscription itself. This is escalation situation (1). I have read the subscription history and the pricing policy. So escalate.\n\nWait - but the customer named invoice INV-2026-0142 and asked for the 10元 difference. Is this a refund on the subscription itself? Yes: \"把差价10块退给我\" - refund of price increase. That's escalation case 1.\n\nBut should I check the invoice? The instruction: \"Escalate in exactly three situations... (1) the customer asks for money back on the subscription itself - a credit, reversal or refund of a price increase, a refund for an unused period, or a refund on cancellation - because only an operator may decide those, and escalate that only after you have read the subscription history and the pricing policy.\"\n\nI've read both. So escalate. No need to read the invoice since the request is about the subscription price increase, not a duplicate charge.\n\nLet me finish with escalate, summary explaining."
          }
        ]
